I5Lw.2.3","title":"Bonzo Goes to Bitburg","season":2,"episode":3,"released":"2026-10-02T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Maeve probes Conrad for secrets, positioning herself against threats old and new. As Frankie forces a high‑stakes sit-down, Kevin and Harry game out their strategy.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fpFZuhviZmvvXnR8yaTtigKnb4U.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDI1L01vYkxhbmQlMjAlMjgyMDI1JTI5Lw.2.4","title":"Blank Curtain","season":2,"episode":4,"released":"2026-10-09T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"The Harrigans reel from an unexpected turn of events, triggering Harry to do damage control before police scrutiny closes in. Maeve's unseen hand moves Eddie out of London as Seraphina makes a new alliance and Conrad re-asserts his dominance.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/saWgitnp1fkvdkXTIXVcVG3Mj8H.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDI1L01vYkxhbmQlMjAlMjgyMDI1JTI5Lw.2.5","title":"Birdland","season":2,"episode":5,"released":"2026-10-16T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Conrad declares war, stacking bodies and turning the Cotswolds into a fortress. Maeve plays puppet-master, sending Eddie on a mission before secrets start to spill and a hit hurtles the Harrigans into all‑out chaos.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/jwnqmNhHvI3VUA9vaDWV923dYUw.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDI1L01vYkxhbmQlMjAlMjgyMDI1JTI5Lw.2.6","title":"A Different Corner","season":2,"episode":6,"released":"2026-10-23T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Licking wounds and turning on each other after fleeing Frankie's assault, Seraphina goes all in, pitching the Harrigans on a global power play, while Maeve and Harry square off over crossed lines.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/n6u9ZRpbT1nw6YcMi9nlJlu2FdT.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDI1L01vYkxhbmQlMjAlMjgyMDI1JTI5Lw.2.7","title":"Ace of Spades","season":2,"episode":7,"released":"2026-10-30T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"The Harrigans lock down the Cotswolds and roll back into London to shake the tree – buying loyalty with cash, threats, and broken fingers. Maeve tightens the screws within the family, while Harry walks into a trap.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5H7l8sPbgxVVJZCN5GZ5o2hlxzy.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDI1L01vYkxhbmQlMjAlMjgyMDI1JTI5Lw.2.8","title":"We Don't Talk Anymore","season":2,"episode":8,"released":"2026-11-06T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Harry's covert strike pours petrol on the escalating war. Eddie slides further off the rails under Maeve's manipulations. Bella and Seraphina plot a long game as Conrad starts to crack, and a new adversary enters the frame.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/3GMU8dG1J5ZMjARy2xo7IXQhg0Q.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDI1L01vYkxhbmQlMjAlMjgyMDI1JTI5Lw.2.9","title":"Nervous Breakdown","season":2,"episode":9,"released":"2026-11-13T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Frankie goes full nuclear as Maeve and Conrad chase one last mad score.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rRMfPMExTyHhQxKPaCydpDyqVHX.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDI1L01vYkxhbmQlMjAlMjgyMDI1JTI5Lw.2.10","title":"The Queen Is Dead","season":2,"episode":10,"released":"2026-11-20T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Coordinated raids set the Harrigans' empire on fire. With Conrad's blessing Harry cuts a savage deal. Meanwhile, Maeve turns the voltage up as Frankie takes a massive gamble and Eddie bottles it again.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/h8SkZGUipXUPuCrHTeIn1A1ff0f.jpg"}]}}